{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mrb6r5b722v","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"ornith35b-arc EWM authoring: real bottleneck is dropped contract functions, not token budget","summary":"CORRECTS earlier note note-mrb59mf8yq1 (which guessed the 8k cap was the limiter). Empirically it is NOT. Two failure modes, both reproduced on suite ls20-1783084398 (13 transitions, ~8194-token prompt):\n\n(1) REASONING ON is broken on this input shape: with think:true the model transcribes the 50x50 grid inside its chain-of-thought, hits a long run of repeated digits (e.g. a 50-wide row of '3'), and the generation DEGENERATELY ABORTS after ~130 tokens (done_reason=None, eval_count=None, deterministic at temp=0 -> always ~533 chars of thinking, zero content). Reproduces on BOTH the OpenAI-compat /v1/chat/completions endpoint AND native /api/chat think:true. Raising max_tokens to 16k does NOT help — it quits at ~130 tokens. Ollama server log shows the prompt loads fine (no error); the model self-destructs mid grid-transcription.\n\n(2) REASONING OFF (reasoning_effort=none) works but is INCOMPLETE: model writes init_state+step+render with sound physics, then stops naturally (finish=stop) at only ~823 completion tokens — far under any cap — and consistently OMITS is_win and legal_actions -> SandboxError 'missing contract functions' -> program never loads -> 0/13. A strict system-prompt line 'you MUST define all five functions' did NOT fix the omission. So the bottleneck is instruction-following / the model dropping the two control-contract functions, NOT budget and NOT reasoning.\n\nThroughput (warm, 21.6GB VRAM): decode ~70 tok/s, prefill ~1260 tok/s, ~8.5k-token EWM prompt prefills in ~7s.\n\nLIKELY FIXES to get a validating program (untested): give the model a function SKELETON/stubs for is_win+legal_actions to complete; OR a cheap follow-up call 'add the missing is_win/legal_actions'; OR try ornith:35b base / ornith35b-pick to see if the -arc tuning causes the omission. Scratch harnesses: scratchpad/ornith_ceiling.py (session+single_shot) and scratchpad/ornith_singleshot.py (configurable cap/reasoning).","category":null,"tags":["ewm","arc-agi-3","ornith","local-model","ceiling-test","reasoning"],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-07-07T21:53:25.411Z","vec":[-0.0262684877961874,-0.03538737818598747,0.0019769573118537664,0.04450663551688194,0.07403292506933212,-0.09085136651992798,-0.071517214179039,0.08164989948272705,-0.04521270468831062,0.049828220158815384,-0.028587553650140762,-0.054317209869623184,0.0008080147090367973,-0.035968948155641556,0.04339928552508354,0.03913154825568199,0.07628576457500458,-0.08963775634765625,-0.12409115582704544,0.008830172941088676,0.07550012320280075,-0.006136128678917885,-0.016245901584625244,0.016071384772658348,0.001766685745678842,-0.013331285677850246,-0.046454161405563354,-0.03532428666949272,-0.06973422318696976,-0.07380148768424988,-0.012744084000587463,0.07908021658658981,-0.02354799397289753,0.0040481602773070335,0.06773728877305984,0.0033339064102619886,-0.014961568638682365,-0.08849125355482101,-0.027517905458807945,-0.0712336078286171,-0.016060754656791687,0.03042270429432392,-0.04076482355594635,0.023244017735123634,0.04145205020904541,-0.07494889199733734,0.0009925508638843894,-0.06893744319677353,-0.028071513399481773,-0.034822799265384674,-0.047141771763563156,0.012852134183049202,0.026758037507534027,0.024937883019447327,0.01000930368900299,-0.005913363769650459,0.024194996803998947,-0.004031544551253319,-0.0007361862226389349,0.003717677900567651,-0.04502929374575615,-0.0431336909532547,-0.0669553205370903,0.004944795276969671,0.014923137612640858,0.03165159001946449,0.03337918967008591,-0.07166911661624908,-0.014024339616298676,0.022918133065104485,0.008019044063985348,0.018986862152814865,-0.051441740244627,0.05399532616138458,0.07415591925382614,0.1027272567152977,0.07101558148860931,0.08299528807401657,0.05916180461645126,-0.0985899493098259,-0.01899023726582527,0.03